When tracing with OpenTelemetry is enabled, Portal | php now adds its own spans for the controller, the requests to Gentics Mesh, the cached Mesh requests, the rendering of views and the HTTP cache, so the time of a request is covered between the incoming request and the requests to Gentics Mesh. The spans need the PHP extension @opentelemetry@ and can be disabled with @OTEL_PHP_DISABLED_INSTRUMENTATIONS=portal-php@.